WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Choose the page from the sidebar
From the sidebar choose “Settings & channels”, then open the “Integrations” tab.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Choose the ad platform
Open Integrations, then the card of the ad platform you use.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Complete the connection
Connect the account with the required permissions. The connection options may differ by platform and by how widely its app is available.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Open event mapping
Choose the “Event mapping” tab and review the settings and the fields the platform requires before turning sending on.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Test the result
Run a test event and check that it arrives in the platform's events manager. Do not send real customer data during the test.
